प्रति-√ मुच् P. Ā. -मुञ्चति, ˚ते, to put (clothes, a garland &c.) on (dat. gen. loc.), to fix or fasten on, append, AV. &c. &c.;
 (Ā., later also P.) to put on one's self, dress one's self, assume (a shape or form), RV. &c. &c.;
to attach or fasten to (loc.), KātyŚr.; BhP.;
to inflict on (loc.), TBr.;
to set at liberty, release, let go, send away, Ragh.; Rājat.; Kathās.;
to give up, resign, Mṛcch.; Pañcat.;
to return, restore, pay back (as a debt), MBh.;
to fling, hurl, RV.; MBh.; R. :
Pass. -मुच्यते, to be freed or released from (abl.), Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -मोचयति, to set free, rescue, save, MBh.
